<title>USA: Delaware County Authority, Pa., deal restructured.</title>
<headline>Delaware County Authority, Pa., deal restructured.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Tuesday it restructured Delaware County Authority, Pa.'s $38.5 million bond deal, adding a 2022 maturity priced to yield 6.13 percent.</p>
<p>The restructuring follows:</p>
<p>DELAWARE COUNTY AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $38,525,000*</p>
<p>HEALTH FACILITIES REVENUE BONDS, SERIES OF 1996</p>
<p>(MERCY HEALTH CORPORATION OF</p>
<p>SOUTHEASTERN PENNSYLVANIA OBLIGATED GROUP)</p>
<p>REVISED VERBAL AWARD PRICING.</p>
<p> MOODY'S: NR		  S&amp;P: BBB+		  FITCH: BBB+</p>
<p> DATED: 12/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 06/15/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 12/15</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>12/15/2016		4,905M    6.00  %	  6.10</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 98.853)</p>
<p>12/15/2020		6,155M    5.75  %	  6.13</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 95.256)</p>
<p>12/15/2022		3,640M    5.75  %	  6.13</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 95.09 )</p>
<p>12/15/2026	     23,825M    6.00  %	  6.15</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 97.956)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 12/15/2006    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 12/15/2008</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, December 4, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on December 18, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
